### **4. Agent Execution Context**

| Step                       | Description                                                                                                             |
| -------------------------- | ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |
| **User Query (Example 1)** | “Show top 5 customers this quarter.” → Routed to **Sales Data Analysis** → Executes `Top_Revenue_Customers_Structured`. |
| **User Query (Example 2)** | “Send an email to Cleveland Clinic.” → Routed to **Send Email to Contacts** → Executes the selected email action.       |
| **Processing**             | Data fetched via Apex / Data Cloud → formatted in Markdown tables → shown in Copilot panel with follow-up options.      |

---

### **5. Data Model & Integrations**

| Source                                              | Usage                                                                          |
| --------------------------------------------------- | ------------------------------------------------------------------------------ |
| **Data Cloud – `Realistic_OrderLine_Datacsv__dlm`** | Sales and revenue data for analytics.                                          |
| **Salesforce Objects**                              | `Account`, `Contact`, `Case`, `Task` for communication, escalation, and email. |
| **Integration Flow**                                | Data Cloud → Apex Agent Actions → Einstein Copilot Output.                     |

